{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.3"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-035",
    "title": "金丹之后"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_219",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "归墟盟主脸色变了：“它已经找到总坛。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "玄霄宗内战暂歇的第二日，归墟盟主抵达回川城。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6264,
          "end": 6264
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他没有带随从，也没有乘坐飞舟，只穿一件旧青衫，从城外的雪路一步步走来。城门守卫想要拦截，却在看见他腰间的半枚铜环后，默默让开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6266,
          "end": 6266
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜站在城楼上等他。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6268,
          "end": 6268
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你不该来。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6270,
          "end": 6270
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你也不该把陆照临带进天门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6272,
          "end": 6272
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他自己选择的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6274,
          "end": 6274
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“选择需要知道代价。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6276,
          "end": 6276
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向城内。回川城的居民仍在修补房屋，部分姓名牌恢复，部分仍是空白。天门已经闭合，却在天空留下了一道无法消散的裂缝。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6278,
          "end": 6278
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你想要什么？”叶观澜问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6280,
          "end": 6280
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主抬起头：“改写权。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6282,
          "end": 6282
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“太虚遗脉的改写权？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6284,
          "end": 6284
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是遗脉，是所有被删去记忆的归属权。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6286,
          "end": 6286
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“归墟盟想替他们决定记住什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6288,
          "end": 6288
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“总比玄霄宗继续决定更好。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6290,
          "end": 6290
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜笑了一下：“你说得和三百年前的盟主一模一样。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6292,
          "end": 6292
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为三百年前他说的是对的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6294,
          "end": 6294
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可他把名字交给了太虚。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6296,
          "end": 6296
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他交的是别人的名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6298,
          "end": 6298
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城楼下传来脚步声。陆照临、顾长离和慧闻走上来。陆照临面色苍白，掌心残印被黑线缠住，金色裂纹仍在气海中缓慢扩展。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6300,
          "end": 6300
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主看向他：“你在天门里见到陆沉舟了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6302,
          "end": 6302
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“见到了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6304,
          "end": 6304
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他还完整吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6306,
          "end": 6306
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不完整。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6308,
          "end": 6308
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那你还想把他带回来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6310,
          "end": 6310
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“想。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6312,
          "end": 6312
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主点头：“这就是归墟盟与玄霄宗不同的地方。我们不保证完整，只保证选择。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6314,
          "end": 6314
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离问：“你们的选择包括把谁交给太虚吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6316,
          "end": 6316
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主看向她颈侧的债契：“顾氏后代，你已经交过一次。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6318,
          "end": 6318
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不是顾氏的账。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6320,
          "end": 6320
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可你继承了它。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6322,
          "end": 6322
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她的铜针微微抬起。叶观澜挡在两人之间：“别在城楼上动手。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6324,
          "end": 6324
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主从袖中取出一枚白色骨牌。骨牌上刻着归墟盟旧坛的地图，地图中央有一扇向内开的门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6326,
          "end": 6326
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆照临，归墟盟可以帮你进入天门第二层。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6328,
          "end": 6328
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“条件？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6330,
          "end": 6330
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把第二枚残印交给我们保管。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6332,
          "end": 6332
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“保管多久？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6334,
          "end": 6334
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“直到天门完全开启。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6336,
          "end": 6336
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“然后呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6338,
          "end": 6338
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“由天下各宗共同决定如何分配被归还的记忆。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6340,
          "end": 6340
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻摇头：“天下各宗共同决定，等于没有人负责。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6342,
          "end": 6342
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主看他：“无相寺只会记录，不会负责。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6344,
          "end": 6344
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记录本身就是责任。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6346,
          "end": 6346
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“责任不等于权力。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6348,
          "end": 6348
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜接过骨牌，指腹在地图门缝上摩挲：“你们内部有人把路线交给了玄霄宗。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6350,
          "end": 6350
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6352,
          "end": 6352
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6354,
          "end": 6354
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6356,
          "end": 6356
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜的脸色变了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6358,
          "end": 6358
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主继续道：“不是你亲自交，但你的旧印被复制过。有人用你的权限打开了归墟盟的路线库。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6360,
          "end": 6360
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你怀疑我？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6362,
          "end": 6362
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我怀疑所有拥有权限的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6364,
          "end": 6364
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以你把我派出来送死？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6366,
          "end": 6366
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我把你派来找持印者。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6368,
          "end": 6368
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“找到之后呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6370,
          "end": 6370
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把他带回盟内。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6372,
          "end": 6372
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜将骨牌捏得发响：“我没有答应。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6374,
          "end": 6374
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主看向陆照临：“你可以现在决定。跟叶观澜走，归墟盟会替你挡住玄霄宗；拒绝，三方都会把你当成天门钥匙。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6376,
          "end": 6376
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临问：“如果我把残印给你，顾长离的债契能解除吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6378,
          "end": 6378
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可以暂时冻结。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6380,
          "end": 6380
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“暂时多久？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6382,
          "end": 6382
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临抬头：“你认识他？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-073",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6408,
          "end": 6408
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他曾经是归墟盟的引灯人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-074",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6410,
          "end": 6410
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主走到他们身后：“所有人都在继承。玄霄宗继承守门，无相寺继承记录，顾氏继承债，归墟盟继承改写。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6622,
          "end": 6622
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那陆照临继承什么？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6624,
          "end": 6624
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主看向他掌中的圆盘：“继承一扇尚未决定向谁开启的门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6626,
          "end": 6626
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "掌心的青痕此时已转成遗脉火线，仍是同一枚残印，只是阶段不同。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6628,
          "end": 6628
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "金丹后的第一阵灵气从陆照临体内展开。石厅所有旧盟约同时翻页，最底部一张被封蜡的纸自行裂开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6630,
          "end": 6630
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "纸上只有一句话：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6632,
          "end": 6632
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“天门真正的钥匙，不是残印，而是一个愿意失去全部记忆的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6634,
          "end": 6634
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向陆照临：“你不会答应。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6636,
          "end": 6636
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6638,
          "end": 6638
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6640,
          "end": 6640
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临抬手，掌心圆盘忽然亮起。石厅外传来第三盏灯的敲击声，紧接着是第四声、第五声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-071",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6642,
          "end": 6642
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主脸色变了：“它已经找到总坛。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-072",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6644,
          "end": 6644
        }
      }
    ],
